{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17547","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 杨於陵","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生赤松侣，混俗游人间。\n崑阆无穷路，何时下故山。\n千年犹孺质，秘术救尘寰。\n莫便冲天去，云雷不可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨於陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}